  "id": "dilly-beans",
  "name": "Dilly Beans",
  "subtitle": "Tangy green beans with dill, garlic, and chile",
  "description": "Crisp green beans are packed with aromatic seasonings and covered with a hot vinegar brine for a bright, savory condiment.",
